# JEMBER REGENCY GOVERNMENT

# JEMBER REGENCY REGIONAL REGULATION

# NUMBER 4 OF 2008

# CONCERNING

# PROTECTION OF WOMEN AND CHILDREN

# VICTIMS OF VIOLENCE IN JEMBER REGENCY

# BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD

# THE REGENT OF JEMBER,

Considering:  
a. that in order to prevent and overcome violence against women and children in Jember Regency so as to avoid violence, threats of violence, torture or treatment that degrades human dignity and honor, it is necessary to provide services and protection for women and children victims of violence in Jember Regency;  
b. that in order for the handling of violence against women and children in Jember Regency to be carried out more effectively and efficiently, it is necessary to regulate the protection of women and children victims of violence in Jember Regency;  
c. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a and letter b, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning the Protection of Women and Children Victims of Violence in Jember Regency.  

In View of:  
1. Law of the Republic of Indonesia Number 1 of 1946 concerning the Criminal Code;  

2. Law of the Republic of Indonesia Number 12 of 1950 concerning the Establishment of Regency Regions within the Province of East Java (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 41 of 1950);  
3. Law of the Republic of Indonesia Number 6 of 1974 concerning Basic Provisions on Social Welfare (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1974 Number 53, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3039);  
4. Law of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4 of 1979 concerning Child Welfare (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1979 Number 32).  
5. Law of the Republic of Indonesia Number 8 of 1981 concerning the Criminal Procedure Code (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1981 Number 76);  

